# Vendored third-party code: the cyaml library, carried verbatim from upstream
# apart from the patches in tools/patches. Its json, path, events and modify
# modules implement features zuyaml never calls and cannot be dropped from the
# tarball, so measuring them reports upstream's coverage rather than this
# package's. The glob is deliberate: a re-vendor that adds a translation unit
# is excluded without anyone remembering to edit this file.
src/cyaml*.c
